<Layout title="Privacy | Kin & Campus" description="At 18 the chart is theirs. Before they join, we write down what to share, and we follow it. This site never asks for symptoms or records.">
<div class="w ph"><div class="eyebrow">Privacy</div><h1>Their chart. The agreement that comes with belonging.</h1><p class="lead">At 18 the chart is theirs. Before they join the program, we write down what they want you to hear. Then we follow it.</p></div>
<div class="w">
<div class="notes">
<div class="note-row"><h3>Day one</h3><p>Hometown physician, city, and phone. We introduce ourselves before anything is wrong, so the year starts with names rather than a scramble.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>The rule</h3><p>Your student has a say. You get the rule we wrote down. We copy you when it counts, like a new medication or an injury. Membership includes that agreement.</p></div>
<div class="note-row"><h3>The hometown doctor</h3><p>They get a note the same afternoon if the plan changes. May starts from a full page, whether the next year is here or at home.</p></div>
</div>
<p class="note">If we believe your student is in danger, we will act to keep them safe, as the law allows. This site never asks for symptoms, diagnoses, or records.</p>
</div>
</Layout>
